# kolby-workflow conventions apply here

This repo follows the [kolby-workflow](https://github.com/KolbyHalcomb/dev-standards) plugin's
skills, installed via the dev-standards marketplace. The load-bearing ones for everyday work:

- **ticket-first** — no implementation without an agent-ready issue; every PR carries `Closes #N`.
- **review-before-advance** — read every comment and review before closing, merging, or deploying;
  implement each item or counter it in writing.
- **delegation** — planner never implements; one ticket per fresh context; parallelize only
  independent tickets.
- **change-workflow / changelog-entry** — confirmed changes get surgical edits plus a dated
  CHANGELOG entry; commit and push only when asked.

Repo-specific specifics (who reviews, status vocabulary, deploy targets) live in this repo's own
brain file per the shared-brain skill — read that too.
